#30338
princess zelda~
Princess Zelda~
Princess Zelda stands free at last, the Triforce of Wisdom shining in her hands.
~
She is pale from her long captivity and her gown is torn at the hem, but
she holds herself like the princess she is, and her eyes are clear and
steady. She broke the Triforce of Wisdom into eight pieces and hid them to
keep them from Ganon, and now they are gathered again because of you. She
thanks you warmly and gravely, without ceremony, and promises that Hyrule
will remember who walked through Death Mountain to bring her home.
~
