#30347
old man sage sooty soot streaked~
a soot-streaked old man~
A soot-streaked old man coughs into his sleeve and wheezes, "Dodongo dislikes smoke."
~
Soot has settled into every wrinkle of his face, and he coughs whenever the
fires beside him gutter. He has lived too long beside smoke to love it, and
he swears the horned beast called Dodongo shares his opinion. Feed the
creature something that smokes and bursts, he hints, patting an empty pouch
at his hip, and it will do to itself what no blade could ever manage. He
seems to find the thought funny, and laughs until the coughing takes him
again.
~
