#30353
old man sage eyepatch with~
an old man with an eyepatch~
An old man with an eyepatch taps the patch over his eye and rasps, "Aim at the eyes of Gohma."
~
A leather patch covers his left eye, and he taps it whenever he wants to be
listened to. The great crab Gohma took the eye, he says, or he took hers;
he can never quite remember which. Her shell turns any blade, but the eye
in the middle of it opens now and then, and only an arrow loosed true at
that moment will finish her. He mimes drawing a bow, sighting carefully
along it with his one good eye, and looks pleased with the shot.
~
