old man sage tally with knotted cord~
an old man with a knotted cord~
An old man with a knotted cord runs a knot through his fingers and mutters, "10th enemy has the bomb."
~
A long cord hangs from his fist, tied with knots, and he runs them through
his fingers like prayer beads. He counts everything, he admits: steps,
breaths, fallen foes. And he has noticed a thing about the creatures of
Hyrule. Strike down ten of them one after another without taking a single
wound, and the tenth leaves a bomb where it falls. Take a scratch and the
count begins again. He ties another knot to show you.
~
