old man sage gaunt~
a gaunt old man~
A gaunt old man stares past you and intones, "Spectacle Rock is an entrance to death."
~
He is thin as a rake and grey as ash, and he speaks like a man reading the
words off a tombstone. High on the mountain, he says, two rocks sit side by
side like a pair of spectacles, and under the left of them lies the way
into the last and deadliest of the labyrinths. Rock gives way to powder, he
hints, if you bring enough of it. He does not wish you luck, but he does
watch you all the way out of the room.
~
