old man sage warden stern~
a stern old man~
A stern old man bars the passage with his staff and declares, "Ones who does not have Triforce can't go in."
~
He stands where the mountain opens, staff held across the passage, and he
does not smile. This mountain lets in only one who carries the Triforce of
Wisdom made whole, he says, all eight pieces together, and he will not let
you pretend otherwise. If you have them, he lowers the staff and bows. If
you have not, he tells you, more kindly than you expect, to go back down
and finish what the eight labyrinths began.
~
