old man sage hollow cheeked~
a hollow-cheeked old man~
A hollow-cheeked old man grins like a death's head and hisses, "Eyes of skull has a secret."
~
His cheeks are so sunken that his face is very nearly a skull already, and
he seems to enjoy the resemblance. This mountain was hollowed out in the
shape of a great skull, he tells you, and like any skull it has two eyes.
In one of them lies the compass; in the other, he hints, lies the reason
anyone climbs up here at all. He points two bony fingers at his own eyes,
then turns them toward the dark beyond.
~
