#30361
old man sage scribe ink stained~
an ink-stained old man~
An ink-stained old man shakes his inky fingers and says, "Patra has the map."
~
His fingers are black to the knuckle with ink, and scraps of half-drawn
maps litter the floor around him, every one abandoned. He tried to chart
this mountain, he says, and failed, but a whirling eye called Patra keeps a
proper map in one of its rooms, circled by its smaller eyes. Find the Patra
and you have found the map. He goes back to drawing, crossing out more than
he keeps, and mutters at his own handwriting.
~
human~
