#30362
old man sage terse~
a terse old man~
A terse old man jerks a thumb at the west wall and grunts, "Go to the next room."
~
He is a man of very few words and has no wish to waste them on you. He
jerks his thumb toward the west wall, grunts, and goes back to warming his
hands. If pressed, he allows that some walls here are thinner than they
look, and that the room beyond has a block in it that does not sit quite as
square as it should. Then he folds his arms, stares into the fire, and that
is all you will get out of him.
~
human~
