#30363
old man sage kindly~
a kindly old man~
A kindly old man holds out a wooden sword and says, "It's dangerous to go alone! Take this."
~
He has a gentle face and a worried one, and the worry is for you. Monsters
walk the fields of Hyrule now, he says, and nobody should go out among them
empty-handed. He keeps a plain wooden sword ready for any traveller who has
none, and would much rather you took it than not. He will not give you a
second while you still carry the first, but if yours is ever lost, he says,
come back; there is always another.
~
