#30364
old man swordkeeper weathered~
a weathered old man~
A weathered old man rests a hand on a white blade and says, "Master using it and you can have this."
~
Wind and spray have weathered him like the cliff his cave is cut into, and
the white sword before him gleams as though he polishes it daily. He looks
first at the blade and then at your chest, counting hearts. Everyone starts
with 3, he explains, and gains one for each guardian of the first eight
labyrinths laid low, and one for each Heart Container taken. Bring him 5
and the sword is yours. Fewer, and he simply waits.
~
