old man swordkeeper gravekeeper grave dusted~
a grave-dusted old man~
A grave-dusted old man rises from the dust under the grave and says, "Master using it and you can have this."
~
Grave dirt clings to his robe and hair, and he seems more at home among the
dead than the living. The finest blade anyone may carry now, the Magical
Sword, lies before him, for the Master Sword belongs to Ganon these days.
He will not hand it to a beginner. Count your hearts against his reckoning:
he wants to see 12 before he lets it go. Until then he sits in the dark
under the stone you pushed aside, patient as the dead above.
~
