old man courier courtly~
a courtly old man~
A courtly old man bows low and offers a sealed letter, saying, "Show this to the old woman."
~
He bows when you come in, stiffly, as a man who once served at court and
has never forgotten how. He has been charged with a letter in Princess
Zelda's own hand, under her seal, and he gives it to you with great
ceremony. The old women who sell medicine in Hyrule will want to see it, he
explains; carry it and their shops will open to you. He straightens his
collar and wishes you a royal welcome wherever you go.
~
