#30367
old man giver toothless~
a toothless old man~
A toothless old man beams a gummy smile and says, "Take any one you want."
~
He has not a tooth left in his head and smiles all the more for it. On the
floor before him lie two gifts, a Heart Container and a red potion, and he
waves a hand over both as though they cost him nothing. But choose
carefully, he lisps: you may take only one, and only once, and the other
stays in his keeping for good. He watches your choice with real interest,
as if he has a wager riding on it.
~
