old man giver patient~
a patient old man~
A patient old man folds his hands beside two gifts and offers, "Take any one you want."
~
He sits so still that dust has gathered in the folds of his sleeves. He has
all the time in the world, he says, and you may take as much of it as you
like to decide. Before him lie a Heart Container, which would make you
stronger for good, and a red potion, which would save your life once. One
of them, and only once, is yours to take. He will not advise you. He only
smiles, and waits, and waits.
~
