old man giver ruddy faced~
a ruddy-faced old man~
A ruddy-faced old man slaps his knee and booms, "Take any one you want."
~
His face is red and round and he laughs at everything, including you.
Gifts, he booms, are his favourite thing in the world, and he has two of
them laid out on a cloth: a Heart Container and a red potion. Take either,
he says, take whichever you like, but only the one, mind, and only this
once, for he is generous and not a fool. He laughs again at that, rather
longer than the joke deserves.
~
