old man giver frail~
a frail old man~
A frail old man pushes two gifts toward you and breathes, "Take any one you want."
~
He is very frail and very small, and it costs him real effort to push the
cloth across the floor toward you. On it lie a Heart Container and a red
potion, the last things of value he owns. He asks only that you take one,
and only once, and leave the other for whoever comes after you. His voice
is barely a breath and his hands shake, but his eyes are bright and kind,
and he is glad you came.
~
