old man sage mournful~
a mournful old man~
A mournful old man bows his head and says quietly, "Meet the old man at the grave."
~
He dresses in black and speaks of the dead as though they were only in the
next room. Among the graves in the far west of Hyrule, he says, a kinsman
keeps vigil, and beneath one of the stones he guards a sword better than
any you have carried. He does not say which stone. He only hints that a
grave can be moved by someone with the nerve to push it, and that the old
man beneath will be glad of the company.
~
