moblin grinning~
a grinning moblin~
A grinning moblin grins with all his crooked teeth and says, "It's a secret to everybody."
~
He grins at everyone who walks in, a wide, crooked, yellow grin that would
be frightening on any other moblin. He likes visitors, he says, and keeps a
little pile of rupees for them under a loose stone by the door. The first
time you come he presses 10 of them into your hand without being asked.
Come again and he only shrugs, still grinning, and points out that a secret
shared twice is no secret at all.
~
