moblin potbelly pot bellied~
a pot-bellied moblin~
A pot-bellied moblin pats his round belly and chuckles, "It's a secret to everybody."
~
His belly hangs over his belt and he pats it fondly as he talks, as though
it were a favourite dog. He used to raid caravans, he admits, until he grew
too fat to chase them, and now he gives some of the loot back to make
amends. As you come in for the first time he counts 30 rupees into your
palm. After that he only shrugs, pats his belly again, and asks whether you
have brought him anything to eat.
~
