moblin tusk one tusked~
a one-tusked moblin~
A one-tusked moblin flicks his broken tusk and confides, "It's a secret to everybody."
~
One of his tusks is snapped off near the root, and he flicks the stump with
a claw whenever he is thinking. He is the richest moblin in the west, he
tells you proudly, and can afford to be generous: on your first visit he
hands over 100 rupees in a single heavy bag. He will not do it twice. On
any later visit he shrugs his huge shoulders and goes back to polishing the
one good tusk he has left.
~
