moblin sleepy~
a sleepy moblin~
A sleepy moblin yawns hugely and mumbles, "It's a secret to everybody."
~
He is always half asleep, slumped against the wall of his cave with his
spear across his knees. Footsteps wake him, and the first time you walk in
he fumbles in a sack and drops 30 rupees into your hand before he has quite
opened his eyes. Visit again and he only shrugs, yawns and settles back
down. He seems to think the whole arrangement is a dream he keeps having,
and is not sure he minds.
