a young moblin~
A young moblin bounces on his heels and squeaks, "It's a secret to everybody."
~
He is young for a moblin, barely tusked, and so excited to have company
that he bounces on his heels. His elders told him to guard the secret of
this cave and he is very proud of the job. He gives every newcomer 10
rupees from a small clay pot, carefully, as if each coin were a great
treasure. On a second visit he shrugs and looks embarrassed, because the
elders said once, and he takes rules seriously.
~
