a gap-toothed merchant~
A gap-toothed merchant whistles through the gap in his teeth and calls, "Buy somethin' will ya!"
~
He whistles through the gap in his front teeth when he talks, and he talks
a great deal. His goods sit on a rough cloth in the firelight: a Magical
Shield at 90 rupees, Bait at 100 and a Recovery Heart at 10. The shield, he
insists, will turn a wizard's spell, and the bait will draw any hungry
beast away from the path. LIST shows his wares and BUY takes them. He does
not haggle, and is offended if you try.
