A shifty gambler shuffles three signs about and whispers, "Let's play money making game."
~
His eyes never rest, and neither do his hands, which shuffle three painted
signs about the floor while he talks. You need 10 rupees in your purse to
play. GAMBLE LEFT, MIDDLE or RIGHT and he turns them over: one sign wins
you 20 or 50, one loses you 10, and the third loses you 10 or 40. He swears
the game is honest. He also swears he has never once lost, and both cannot
be true.
~
