#31134
zol slime~
a zol~
A zol slumps against a scraped block, oozing slowly across the floor.
~
Grey dust from the Lizard's stonework has settled into this zol's skin
until it looks like a mound of mouldy pea soup. It is heavier and slower to
rouse than the Manji's slimes, but once it moves it hops in sudden long
bounds that cover half a room. Its outer skin has thickened, so a feeble
cut splits it into two gels that carry on the fight, and only a forceful
blow breaks the whole of it at once.
~
unique~
