a zol~
A zol rises from the cistern's scum, dripping in thick green ropes.
~
Bred in the stagnant cisterns of the Dragon, this zol has grown huge and
dark, almost black at its heart, with flecks of ash floating in its jelly
like trapped insects. It smells of standing water and old smoke. It lunges
in heavy, slapping hops and tries to swallow its prey whole. Strike it
lightly and the halves crawl apart as two gels; strike with real weight and
it bursts across the walls.
~
unique~
