~
Ancient iron, black with age and crusted with volcanic ash, forms the great
spiked block that guards this stairwell inside Death Mountain. Its spikes
are as long as daggers and its corners have been ground round. It triggers
at the slightest movement in its line and hurtles across with a roar like a
rockslide, then drags itself back with a long, grating moan. No weapon has
