triforce shard piece first 1~
This is the first of the eight shards of Wisdom, from the Eagle's chest. It
is one of nine Triforce pieces, one from each of Hyrule's dungeon
guardians: eight of Wisdom, and Ganon's Power. Carry it: Level 2's door
opens only for one who has it. With all nine in hand, type COMBINE TRIFORCE
to make the Triforce.
~
