magical shield~
A broad shield whose face is worked with a red cross and a golden bird.
Held, it turns aside a tenth of any fire or magic thrown at you -- a
guardian's fireballs, a wizzrobe's beam -- though the Mirror Shield,
which does more, cannot be carried with it. Beware the like like.
~
