triforce power piece ninth ganon~
This is Ganon's own, the ninth piece, taken from his great chest. It is one
of nine Triforce pieces, one from each of Hyrule's dungeon guardians: eight
of Wisdom, and Ganon's Power. It is the last; the others open the dungeons,
and this one completes them. With all nine in hand, type COMBINE TRIFORCE
to make the Triforce.
