Rock Wall Above the Start~
A wall of brown rock rises along the north side of a grassy field, its face
scarred and cracked. One section looks weaker than the rest, a hollow knock
answering any tap on it, as if a bomb might break it open on somebody's
hidden savings. Red-flecked pebbles lie spat across the grass. Trails lead
east and west, and south toward the cave in the hills where the quest
begins.
