River Bend~
A broad river swings through open country here, its water deep and green
beneath an undercut, rocky bank. Reeds grow thick along the edge and
dragonflies skim the shallows. Every so often the surface bulges, a finned
head rises with a burning glow in its throat, and a wake slides away
downstream. Dry ground leads north, east and west along the curve.
