A swift river splashes over a stony ford in the middle of the woods, cold
and clear. The banks are slick with mud and covered in wet prints, and a
sudden ripple now and then betrays a finned head that rises, spits a
glowing ball, and slips under again. Spat pebbles litter the shallows.
Paths lead on in all four directions.
