Shore Below the Snake~
The forest gives way to the western waters of Lake Hylia, glittering under
an open sky. A small island rises a short distance to the north, and a dark
serpent-shaped doorway can just be glimpsed on it across a channel too wide
to step and narrow enough to bridge with a ladder. Paths lead east, west
and south along the shore, where the water sometimes spits fire.
