The Still Pond~
A ring of tall dark trees closes in around a round, perfectly still pond,
its surface black and glassy, and no fairy has ever danced over it. Smooth
carved stones edge the water as though something was built beneath it long
ago. Old folk say there are secrets where fairies do not live, and that a
certain tune can make even sleeping water draw back. The only way out is
the forest track to the south.
