#30313
Lynel Ridge~
A high ridge of rust-brown rock runs east and west, its ground churned by
heavy hooves and dotted with scorched patches where something spat fire.
One stretch of the cliff face is webbed with fine cracks, as though the
stone behind it were hollow and lived in, and whoever lives there will want
the door paid for. A deep crevice bars the way south.
