#30316
The Medicine Woman's Ledge~
Walled in on three sides by brown crags, this quiet ledge opens only to the
east. A dark cave mouth is set into the rock, its threshold swept clean,
and a faint bitter smell of boiled herbs drifts out of it, the shop of a
woman who sells medicine to those carrying a royal letter. The ground
nearby is trampled by heavy hooves, and the wind moans over the rim.
