#30320
Avalanche Slope~
The mountain sheds itself constantly here. Rocks break loose from the
heights and come bouncing down in long arcs, smashing into gravel on the
boulders below. The path east and west is littered with shattered stone,
the dust never quite settles, and the safest pace through is a run.
