#30322
The White Sword Falls~
A river spills over the lip of the mountain and drops in a roaring white
curtain, filling the air with cold spray and rainbows. At the very top of
the climb a cave mouth opens in the rock beside the falls, half hidden by
mist, and the stone around it is worn smooth by those who came to prove
their strength. Ripples in the pool below suggest something finned moves
beneath. A crevice lies south.
~
