#30323
The Lizard's Gate~
Beyond the confusing folds of the Lost Hills the ground levels into a
hidden basin of reddish sand. At its heart a squat entrance is cut into the
stone, framed in a carved shape like a crouching lizard, its doorway black
and cool. Dry wind hisses through the sand where something red bores up and
dives again, and a crevice bars the way back south.
