#30326
Ledge of the Letter Cave~
A lonely ledge looks out over the eastern slopes, with a cave mouth gaping
in the cliff behind it. Inside, a warm glow flickers, as though a pair of
fires were kept burning against the cold. Someone has chalked beside the
entrance: SHOW THIS TO THE OLD WOMAN. The wind is softer here, and a
crevice falls away to the south.
