#30327
The Northeast Crag~
The far corner of the mountains ends in a sheer brown crag above the
eastern wilds, the eastmost point of Hyrule's high country. A dark cave
opens in its base, small and easily overlooked, and over the entrance
someone has scrawled: IT'S A SECRET TO EVERYBODY. Stubborn shrubs grow in
the cracks, and a deep crevice to the south falls away into shadow.
