#30332
Sand-Floored Hermitage~
Fine pale sand has blown in from the glade and drifted against the walls of
this snug cave, deep enough to swallow your heels. The ceiling is low and
smoke-stained, and a pair of fires burn in a ring of stones at the back,
throwing long shadows that seem to point toward the graveyard far to the
north. A walking stick has worn a groove in the floor near the fires. The
way out is up the stairs into the glade.
