#30333
The Statue's Undercroft~
Grit and broken stone from the Armos base sprinkle the steep stair down
into this narrow chamber, and the scrape of the statue sliding aside still
seems to hang in the air. The walls are bare carved rock, and twin fires
burn in sconces at the far end. Leaves and bark shavings are tracked across
the floor, as though whoever keeps this place has lately come from some old
tree. Steps lead up to the ridge.
