#30400
Level 1: West Guardroom~
A plain square chamber of teal flagstones, its corners furred with dust and
spattered with bat droppings. Something leathery has left fine scratches
along the high ledges, and a faint, erratic flutter echoes from the
ceiling, swooping and stopping and swooping again. Two stone eagles stand
in the corners with their wings folded. The only way out is the open
doorway east, back toward the entry.
