#30401
Level 1: Eagle Gate~
Cold teal stone rises on every side of this first chamber, the walls carved
with rows of grim, staring faces and a great eagle spreading its wings
above the north door. Daylight from the stair behind fades within a few
paces, and the air smells of wet rock and bats. Open doorways lead east and
west, while the northern door is barred shut and fitted with a heavy iron
keyhole.
