#30402
Level 1: East Bone Room~
Bleached bone fragments lie scattered across the tiled floor of this
chamber, and the air carries the dry, chalky smell of old marrow. Two squat
stone blocks stand near the middle like plinths waiting for statues, their
edges nicked by rusty sword blows. Now and then the bones seem to shift and
click on their own. A single open doorway leads west to the entry.
