Level 1: Rattling Passage~
A row of squat stone blocks runs across the middle of this chamber,
dividing it into two narrow lanes. Bones have been kicked into the corners
beside a dented shield and a notched sword, and a faint rattle lingers
after every sound, like a skeleton jumping in place. A locked door with a
brass-ringed keyhole leads south, back toward the gate, and an open arch
leads north.
