#30405
Level 1: Diamond-Tiled Crossing~
Four ways meet in this broad chamber, its floor laid in worn diamond-
patterned tiles around a square of raised blocks. Bones and a broken shield
lie in the corners. A heavy iron shutter is sunk into the western doorway,
and open arches lead east and south. Part of the north wall is crazed with
dark hairline fissures, as if a bomb might bring it down.
