Level 1: Keese-Fouled Gallery~
The vaulted ceiling of this gallery vanishes into darkness, and the stale
air is thick with the musk of roosting bats. Droppings crust the floor
between low rows of raised blocks, the teal walls are streaked white
beneath every ledge, and the rafters are scored with tiny claw marks. An
open doorway leads west, and a patch of the north wall is cracked and
sounds hollow, as if a bomb would open it.
