Level 1: Eagle's Ember Alcove~
Teal flagstones run back to a squat pair of braziers whose flames burn low
and patient, the kind tended by someone who expects few visitors. Between
the fires the stone is rubbed pale by long standing, and soot has painted a
soft grey shape like an eagle's wing up the wall behind them. The room is
warm, still and oddly homely for a dungeon. A heavy iron shutter seals the
eastern doorway.
