Level 1: Slime-Slick Hall~
The flagstones here are tacky with a glistening film, and small wet smears
wander across them where little blobs of jelly creep and hop. The smell is
sour, like spoiled broth. One block in the middle of the floor sits askew,
scraped as though pushing it works some hidden catch. A locked door leads
south, an open archway leads east, and a heavy iron shutter fills the
western doorway.
