Level 1: Hall of Threefold Scorches~
Scorch marks blacken the floor of this long chamber, every blast fanning
out in three paths from a raised ledge of stone at the eastern end, its lip
gouged by heavy claws. The air is hot and stinks of sulphur and charred
bone, and the teal tiles nearest the ledge have cracked in the heat. A
locked door leads south, and the door east, marked with an eagle around its
keyhole, opens only to the guardian's key.
