#30414
Level 1: Eagle's Golden Sanctum~
Smooth teal stone encloses this small, hushed sanctum, its walls inlaid
with a triangle within a triangle. A soft golden glow hangs in the air
though nothing here burns, and above the floor turns a triangle of light
that would carry a hero home. An iron-banded chest stands locked at the
centre, and the heavy door west, back toward the dragon's lair, bears the
eagle's mark around its keyhole.
