#30417
Level 1: Undercroft of Brick Ledges~
A narrow ladder drops into a long basement of brick ledges and black gaps,
the kind of place one crosses sideways, a ledge at a time. The air smells
of turned earth and old candle stubs, and the lowest rung of the ladder is
polished bright. Somebody's hoard of rupees was tucked on a stone shelf at
the far end. The ladder climbs back up to the chamber above.
