Level 2: Crescent Gate~
Pale blue stone surrounds this entrance hall, its walls carved with
crescent moons worn soft by time and a pair of stone dragons crouched
beside the doors. A chill draught spills down the stair behind, carrying
the smell of the lake outside. Faint slither tracks cross the dust. Open
doorways lead north and east into the darker halls beyond.
