Level 2: Crescent Moon Sanctum~
Quiet blue stone walls this sanctum in the dungeon's far northwest, a
crescent moon carved above a triangle of gold leaf. A gentle golden light
fills the air, and a triangle of light turns slowly in it, ready to bear
the victor home. The hush is deep after the smoke next door. An iron-banded
chest waits locked on the floor, and the door east, back to the lair, is
locked with the moon's own key.
