wide square around two braziers set against the north wall. The fires
crackle with a cheerful popping, and amber light runs along a frieze of
turning crosses carved just below the ceiling. A threadbare mat lies
between the flames, flattened by long use. Heavy iron shutters seal the
south and west doorways.
