Level 9: Whispering Hearth Room~
Barely wider than a corridor, this room holds two flickering fires, a worn
patch of floor between them and almost nothing else. A cold draught threads
through the cracks of the west wall and tugs the flames sideways, as if
beckoning onward. Faded footprints lead from the fires toward that wall and
stop. A locked door with a keyhole leads south, and the west wall shows a
cracked and weakened section.
