smaller: NINE GUARDIANS, IN ORDER. EACH KEEPS A KEY; EACH KEY A CHEST; EACH
CHEST A PIECE OF THE TRIFORCE AND WHAT THE NEXT DUNGEON ASKS OF YOU.
